  "id": "fields-yearly",
  "title": "FTW Global (beta) — Fields by year (PMTiles)",
  "description": "Browsable field-boundary tiles for 2025: one PMTiles archive per year with a zoom handover — A5 r7 cell aggregates (`cells` layer, z0–8: count, area_ha, avg_field_prob, avg_boundary_prob, pct_covered) switching to the full field polygons with all attributes (`fields` layer, z9–13). Open it in the [data browser](https://source.coop/ftw/global-data-beta). Part of [Fields of the World](https://fieldsofthe.world) — agricultural field boundaries delineated from Sentinel-2 imagery.",
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
